DSH embedded DeepSeek Chat, preview implementation (2026).

Independent community plugin; not an official DeepSeek product.
The approved webview lease/bootstrap pattern follows DeepSeek Harness Desktop's
Sidebar Browser implementation (MIT):
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

The original research also examined xmuwenxiang/dsh-web-chat (Apache-2.0).
The current native-only package contains no Chrome engine or code from that
project's web-message transport.

React is provided by the DSH host. Development dependencies retain their own
licenses and are not bundled in the production client.

Deferred-tool request compatibility: src/compat/all-deferred-tools-guard is
vendored from @argszero/dsh-all-deferred-tools-guard 0.1.0 (MIT). Its license is
preserved in that directory. Upstream: https://github.com/argszero/dsh-all-deferred-tools-guard
The request shape is tested against the locally installed DSH 0.2.2-rc.1.
